      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The bindings applied to VRChat do not affect how SteamVR treats skeletal input data.\n\nOne way around your particular issue would be to unbind the thumbstick touch gesture in the VRChat bindings as you mention and then use Legacy Fingers on your avatar (you can enable this setting in your Action Menu next to your Avatar Scale). This should respect the binding for the thumb position.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
